<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Dear Sir,</p>

    <p>We request the following modifications in the existing Bank Guarantee:</p>

    <p>
        {{#if data.referenceValue}}<strong>WO No./Tender No.:</strong> {{data.referenceValue}}<br>{{/if}}
        <strong>Bank Guarantee No.:</strong> {{data.bgNo}}<br>
        <strong>Bank Guarantee Date:</strong> {{data.bgDate}}<br>
        <strong>Bank Guarantee Value:</strong> Rs. {{data.amount}}<br>
        <strong>Bank Guarantee in favor of:</strong> {{data.bgFavour}}<br>
        <strong>Bank Guarantee Amount:</strong> Rs. {{data.amount}}
    </p>

    <table style="border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: left;">Type of Amendment</th>
                <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: left;">Existing Value</th>
                <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: left;">New Value</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">Stamp Paper Amount</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.stampChargeDeducted}}</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.newStampChargeDeducted}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">Beneficiary Name</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.bgFavour}}</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.newBeneficiaryName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">Amount</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">Rs. {{data.amount}}</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.newAmount}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">Expiry Date</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.bgExpiryDate}}</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.newExpiryDate}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">Claim Date</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.bgClaimDate}}</td>
                <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 10px;">{{data.newClaimDate}}</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>
        The request letter or email confirmation from the client is attached with this mail. Please debit our account
        no. <strong>003063300010771</strong> for any additional charges on this modification.
    </p>

    <p>Please find attached the following documents:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Request letter on VE letterhead</li>
        <li>Request letter or email from the client for extension or modification of the Bank Guarantee</li>
        <li>Soft copy of the Bank Guarantee</li>
        <li>Soft copy of the FDR</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        The hard copy of the Bank Guarantee and the request letter on our letterhead has been sent to your branch.
        Please contact the undersigned for any clarification.
    </p>

    <p>
        Best Regards,<br>
        {{data.senderName}}<br>
        Tendering, Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.
    </p>

    <p>
        Piyush Goyal<br>
        Director<br>
        Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.
    </p>

    <p>
        Imran Khan<br>
        +91-88825-91733<br>
        Accounts Leader<br>
        Volks Energie Pvt. Ltd.
    </p>
</div>
